>VpNac
mṛte ca mayi sarvvaṃ me putradāraṃ vinasyati | rakṣamānaḥ kapotaṃ tvaṃ bahūn prāṇān na ra¦kṣasi |
>VpNpc
mṛte ca mayi sarvvaṃ me putradāraṃ vinaśyati | rakṣamānaḥ kapotaṃ tvaṃ bahūn prāṇān na ra¦kṣasi |
>MbhC
pramṛte mayi dharmātman putradāraṃ naśiṣyati | rakṣamānaḥ kapotaṃ tvaṃ bahūn prāṇān naśiṣyasi || 9
>MbhS
pramṛte mayi sarvaṃ me putradāraṃ mariṣyati | rakṣan_ kapotaṃ rājaṃs tvaṃ bahūn_ prāṇān haniṣyasi || 9
>VpBh
mṛte mayi nṛpaśreṣṭha putradārādikaṃ kulam | vinaśyati kathaṃ dharmo bhavitā te nṛpottama || 24 ||
>VpBh-A
mṛte mayi nṛpaśreṣṭha yatradārādikaṃ kulam | vinaśyati kathaṃ dharmo bhavitā te nṛpottama || 24 ||
>VpBh-B
mṛte mayi nṛpaśreṣṭha putradārādikaṃ kulam | vinaśyati kathaṃ dharmo bhavitā te nṛpottama || 24 ||
>VpBh-C
mṛte mayi nṛpaśreṣṭha putradārādikaṃ kulam | vinaśyati kathaṃ dharmo bhavitā te nṛpottama || 24 ||
>VpBh-D
mṛte mayi nṛpaśreṣṭha putradārādikaṃ kulam | vinaśyati kathaṃ dharmo bhavitā te nṛpottama || 24 ||
